## Scope boundaries (explicitly NOT in this patch)

- No production source, anchor hashes, or frozen thresholds are read into or changed.
- No GPU workloads; no CPU result is relabeled as device qualification — the host/device
  gap isolated by the base diagnostic stays open and missing qualification is preserved as missing.
- No digital signature, secret, or human identity; a pinned expected digest is the trust-anchor stand-in.
- No physics recomputation equations or tolerances are touched.
